      "contextFingerprint": "3301eac768cb9baea63975da61141c9daf1d6a0f4ae1064df180d208584cdfb6",
      "sourceText": "这些是例程中不同函数的使用片段，不是要粘贴到同一个函数里的完整程序。STM32 端收到 `0x01`、`0x02` 后，回调分别更新 `cmd_vel`、`set_mode`；它自身周期性发送 `0x01`，没有周期性回发 `0x02`。例程接收回调在中断中调用 `feed()`，自己的业务回调应保持简短；如果改为多个任务或中断共同访问同一个协议对象，要把协议操作集中到一个任务中。",
      "translatedText": "These are usage snippets of different functions in the example routines, not a complete program to be pasted into the same function\\. After the STM32 side receives `0x01` and `0x02` , the callbacks update `cmd_vel` and `set_mode` respectively; it periodically sends `0x01` itself, and does not periodically send back `0x02` \\. The example's receive callback is called in an interrupt with `feed()` ; your own business callback should be kept short; if multiple tasks or interrupts access the same protocol object together, the protocol operations should be concentrated into one task\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 216,
        "outputTokens": 109,
        "costUsd": 0.000196
      }
