      "sourceText": "| 用法 | 说明 | 何时使用 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| `for (auto x : c)` | 值拷贝遍历 | 元素类型小（int/double 等） |\n| `for (const auto& x : c)` | 只读引用遍历 | **最常用**，不想拷贝大对象 |\n| `for (auto& x : c)` | 可修改引用遍历 | 需要修改容器中元素 |\n| `for (int x : {1, 2, 3})` | 遍历初始值列表 | 快速遍历已知小集合 |",
      "translatedText": "| Usage | Description | When to use |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| `for (auto x : c)` | Value copy traversal | Element type is small (int/double etc\\.) |\n| `for (const auto& x : c)` | Read\\-only reference traversal | **Most commonly used**do not want to copy large objects |\n| `for (auto& x : c)` | Modifiable reference traversal | Need to modify elements in the container |\n| `for (int x : {1, 2, 3})` | Traverse initializer list | Quickly traverse a known small collection |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
